{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>WorkoutMaker 是一款健身訓練紀錄工具，適合希望有系統安排每週訓練、記錄重量與次數，並查看進度變化的健身人士。原價 US $0.99，目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，無需訂閱、無廣告，亦不需建立帳戶。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-58.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>訓練紀錄與進度一目瞭然</h2>\n<p>用戶可建立每週訓練表，安排訓練日、休息日及自訂訓練名稱，並從動作庫選取或新增動作。訓練時可記錄重量、次數、徒手動作、計時支撐與有氧時間或距離，亦可對照上次表現複製數值。程式支援遞減組、休息暫停組與倒數計時，並提供訓練量及有氧時間圖表。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-472-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-473-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-474-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-475-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-476-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-477-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：WorkoutMaker: Gym Tracker</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/workoutmaker-gym-tracker/id6738848476?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:54.148420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":297,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T00:17:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T15:19:54.404794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:43.301715+00:00","content_hash":"03d2bb0ff6233b9b4c05573502854a91daa9b63fbdc6c85ec35b45fd114e5de9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}